window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>What could go wrong in the game of love? <br> <br> Alice is desperate for a change. When she mixes work with pleasure, it backfires. Quitting her job she once loved, she sets out on a new adventure with a new company. Best friend, Becks, thinks she needs a rebound. Though she is probably right, Alice isn’t sure how she feels about it. With high hopes, Alice keeps an open mind when she gets set up, but she’s quickly disappointed.<br> <br> Logan is cocky, brazen, and vain. Although he has a right to be because he’s hot, she just isn’t into that kind of guy. Thinking her time with Logan is over, she runs into him in the most unexpected way. They quickly become great friends when she starts to see the real him underneath the cockiness. Friendship turns into a scandalous game of love and work that’s supposed to be innocent.<br> <br> Then comes Ryder…. a sexy, mysterious, and dominant soul she meets at a bar. The three quickly become intertwined, and Alice has to decide which one will keep her heart safe regardless of how much they make her toes curl. Because all’s fair in love and work.</p>"; 
